      { "sa": "tat-anantaram", "en": "immediately after that" }
    ],
    "translation": "By devotion he comes to know me, how great and who I am in truth. Then, having known me in truth, he enters immediately after that.",
    "notes": ["\"He enters immediately after that\" can also be read as \"he enters that without delay\", where \"that\" is what he enters."]
  },
